# Conformance vectors are byte-exact payloads; git must never touch them.
# case10.bin is a lone 0x0A and case13.bin a lone 0x0D — both pass git's
# text heuristic, so without this line autocrlf/text=auto could corrupt
# them on checkout. The .txt vectors' no-trailing-newline property is
# load-bearing too.
tests/vectors/** binary
